// Committed signing config (safe to commit — contains no account identifiers).
//
// The personal Apple Development Team ID is kept out of version control: it
// lives in the gitignored Signing.local.xcconfig and is pulled in by the
// OPTIONAL include below. Because XcodeGen reads this file (not the include
// target) when generating, no Team ID is baked into the tracked project.pbxproj;
// Xcode resolves it at build time.
//
// Missing Signing.local.xcconfig (e.g. a fresh clone) is fine: the optional
// include is skipped, so no team is set — simulator builds still work, and a
// device build just needs the team picked once in Xcode → Signing & Capabilities.
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
